%% PlaceX - Official Placement Eligibility Data Flow
flowchart LR
    classDef actor fill:#0f172a,color:#ffffff,stroke:#0f172a,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef process fill:#ede9fe,color:#4c1d95,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef deterministic fill:#e0f2fe,color:#0c4a6e,stroke:#0284c7,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef store fill:#ecfdf5,color:#065f46,stroke:#10b981,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef note fill:#f8fafc,color:#334155,stroke:#94a3b8,stroke-dasharray: 4 3

    Student([Student]):::actor
    TPO([TPO / Admin]):::actor
    Profiles[("student_profiles<br/>branch, CGPA, backlogs, graduationYear, skills")]:::store
    Drives[("jobs - ON_CAMPUS<br/>eligibleBranches, minimumCgpa, maximumBacklogs,<br/>graduationYears, requiredSkills, publish status")]:::store

    Student -->|"profile maintenance"| Profiles
    TPO -->|"drive criteria; draft / publish"| Drives
    Student -->|"view a published drive"| Request["Placement job request"]:::process
    Drives --> Request
    Profiles --> Request

    Request --> Branch["Branch check<br/>normalizeBranch on student and drive values;<br/>'all' matches every branch"]:::deterministic
    Request --> Cgpa["CGPA check<br/>student CGPA >= minimum CGPA"]:::deterministic
    Request --> Backlogs["Backlog check<br/>student backlogs <= maximum"]:::deterministic
    Request --> Year["Graduation-year check<br/>student year is listed"]:::deterministic
    Request --> Skills["Required-skills check<br/>central skill normalization"]:::deterministic

    Branch --> Evaluate["evaluateEligibility"]:::process
    Cgpa --> Evaluate
    Backlogs --> Evaluate
    Year --> Evaluate
    Skills --> Evaluate
    Evaluate --> Decision{"All official checks pass?"}:::deterministic
    Decision -->|"Yes"| Eligible["Eligible<br/>criteria source: OFFICIAL_TPO_ELIGIBILITY"]:::process
    Decision -->|"No"| Ineligible["Not eligible<br/>per-check values and reasons returned"]:::process
    Eligible --> Student
    Ineligible --> Student

    Note["Drive analytics separately combines fixed-criteria results with a selected JD evidence source to form Eligible, Partial Match, and Not Eligible cohorts. That classification does not replace this official evaluator."]:::note
    Evaluate -.-> Note
